    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14: Overmind</strong> is a cosmic survival experience where you confront the unknown reaches of space. Prepare for epic adventures in a universe filled with secrets, resources, and perilous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/efb94a1cd34689bee74b5410c7daf1c8.poster.avif?t=1755160215\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/efb94a1cd34689bee74b5410c7daf1c8.webm?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/efb94a1cd34689bee74b5410c7daf1c8.mp4?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dynamic Open World with Unique Biomes</strong><br>Each biome presents a fresh challenge. Environments radically shift gameplay, introducing unique mechanics and hazards. Embark on a journey where every biome isn\u2019t just a setting but an evolving threat or opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/59de3972d36422d38e6a4a4384e5120a.avif?t=1755160215\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Intuitive Crafting System</strong><br>Discover rare resources from anomalous zones and use cutting-edge technologies to forge your path to survival. Each crafting process is enhanced with innovative tools and visually stunning effects, making resource gathering both engaging and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/083b57aac97623fd670e488ec5b78c19.poster.avif?t=1755160215\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/083b57aac97623fd670e488ec5b78c19.webm?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/083b57aac97623fd670e488ec5b78c19.mp4?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Ship Control System</strong> <br>Take command of unique spacecraft equipped with immersive interaction systems! Every button and sensor on your dashboard responds to your input. Your decisions shape your flight trajectory, and the path you choose will determine the fate of your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/c4037a680f6226a3069da035d6fcaf99.avif?t=1755160215\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Threats from the Fifth Dimension</strong><br>Anomalous zones distort the very laws of physics, complicating your movement and navigation. But the true danger lies with fractals \u2014 enigmatic entities from the fifth dimension. Each encounter with these beings requires a distinct strategy, as they bend the rules of time and space, creating dynamic, unpredictable challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/f3a48a6574a1a33961e558e1910b706d.avif?t=1755160215\" data-has-big width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep and intriguing plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distant future. A black hole emerges in Earth\u2019s orbit, releasing a huge amount of anomalous energy. Earth and everything near it is destroyed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near the spaceship \u201cMiner\u201d, surrounded by debris, an engineer comes to his senses, left completely alone. He remembers nothing about who he is, where he came from, or how he ended up here, in the cold, endless space\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing that guides him is the instinct for survival and the desire to find answers to the questions: what really happened and why did he survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/bbe73ef6b8c678809ad8c4177c342ebf.poster.avif?t=1755160215\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/bbe73ef6b8c678809ad8c4177c342ebf.webm?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/bbe73ef6b8c678809ad8c4177c342ebf.mp4?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14: Overmind</strong> is a cosmic survival experience where you confront the unknown reaches of space. Prepare for epic adventures in a universe filled with secrets, resources, and perilous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/efb94a1cd34689bee74b5410c7daf1c8.poster.avif?t=1755160215\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/efb94a1cd34689bee74b5410c7daf1c8.webm?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/efb94a1cd34689bee74b5410c7daf1c8.mp4?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dynamic Open World with Unique Biomes</strong><br>Each biome presents a fresh challenge. Environments radically shift gameplay, introducing unique mechanics and hazards. Embark on a journey where every biome isn\u2019t just a setting but an evolving threat or opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/59de3972d36422d38e6a4a4384e5120a.avif?t=1755160215\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Intuitive Crafting System</strong><br>Discover rare resources from anomalous zones and use cutting-edge technologies to forge your path to survival. Each crafting process is enhanced with innovative tools and visually stunning effects, making resource gathering both engaging and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/083b57aac97623fd670e488ec5b78c19.poster.avif?t=1755160215\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/083b57aac97623fd670e488ec5b78c19.webm?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/083b57aac97623fd670e488ec5b78c19.mp4?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Ship Control System</strong> <br>Take command of unique spacecraft equipped with immersive interaction systems! Every button and sensor on your dashboard responds to your input. Your decisions shape your flight trajectory, and the path you choose will determine the fate of your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/c4037a680f6226a3069da035d6fcaf99.avif?t=1755160215\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Threats from the Fifth Dimension</strong><br>Anomalous zones distort the very laws of physics, complicating your movement and navigation. But the true danger lies with fractals \u2014 enigmatic entities from the fifth dimension. Each encounter with these beings requires a distinct strategy, as they bend the rules of time and space, creating dynamic, unpredictable challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/f3a48a6574a1a33961e558e1910b706d.avif?t=1755160215\" data-has-big width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep and intriguing plot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distant future. A black hole emerges in Earth\u2019s orbit, releasing a huge amount of anomalous energy. Earth and everything near it is destroyed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near the spaceship \u201cMiner\u201d, surrounded by debris, an engineer comes to his senses, left completely alone. He remembers nothing about who he is, where he came from, or how he ended up here, in the cold, endless space\u2026\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing that guides him is the instinct for survival and the desire to find answers to the questions: what really happened and why did he survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/bbe73ef6b8c678809ad8c4177c342ebf.poster.avif?t=1755160215\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/bbe73ef6b8c678809ad8c4177c342ebf.webm?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691090/extras/bbe73ef6b8c678809ad8c4177c342ebf.mp4?t=1755160215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019re alone in space. Your goal is to survive. Utilize futuristic technologies to transform an abandoned base into a safe haven. Explore new worlds, build your own spaceship, and become the master of the stars! Your story begins in Overmind.",
